        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{81}{a^{12}}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\left(\\frac3{a^3}\\right)^4&=\\frac{3^4}{a^{3\\times4}}\\\\\\left(\\frac3{a^3}\\right)^4&=\\frac{81}{a^{12}}\\end{align*}$$",
