          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\left(\\frac{8r^3}{t^6}\\right)^{\\frac13}&=\\frac{8^{\\frac13}r^{3\\times\\frac13}}{t^{6\\times\\frac13}}\\\\\\left(\\frac{8r^3}{t^6}\\right)^{\\frac13}&=\\frac{2r}{t^2}\\end{align*}$$",
